&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #7474ee;&quot;&gt;The people around you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We hire to a high standard, and you&#39;ll feel it. The talent at Bash will push your thinking, raise your game, and genuinely surprise you.&lt;/p&gt;
